@startuml aws-runtime-invocation
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Runtime invocation of an internal function on AWS (lambda:invoke)

actor "Client" as U
participant "AWS Step Functions" as SFN
participant "AWS Lambda" as L
participant "Handler\n(QuickFaaS template + hook)" as H

U -> SFN : StartExecution(input)
note over SFN
  Task state
  Resource: arn:aws:states:::lambda:invoke
  Parameters: FunctionName = <ARN>
end note
SFN -> L : Invoke(FunctionName, Payload)
L -> H : template entry point -> hook function
H --> L : response
L --> SFN : { Payload: ... }
note over SFN
  ResultSelector extracts $.Payload
  into the step's result variable
end note
SFN -> SFN : transition to next state
SFN --> U : ExecutionSucceeded
@enduml
